---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";import {governance,methodologySections,observationSchema} from "../../data/research";
---
<BaseLayout title="How the AI answer comparison is calculated" canonicalPath="/research/methodology" description="The detailed rules and local calculations behind the browser-based AI answer comparison."><div class="document-layout"><aside class="document-aside"><dl><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Public draft</dd></div><div><dt>Responsible</dt><dd>{governance.researchOwner}</dd></div><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>0.1</dd></div><div><dt>Published comparisons</dt><dd>0</dd></div></dl></aside><article class="document-body"><h1>How the answer comparison is calculated</h1><p class="document-intro">These are the detailed rules for the browser-based comparison tool. No provider collection has started, and no provider benchmark dataset exists.</p><ol class="method-list">{methodologySections.map(section=><li id={section.id}><span>{section.number}</span><div><h2>{section.title}</h2><p>{section.body}</p></div></li>)}</ol><h2>Fields in the exported data</h2><pre><code>{`{\n${observationSchema.map(([field])=>`  ${field}:`).join("\n")}\n}`}</code></pre><p><a href="/methodology">Return to how the free fanout tool works</a>.</p></article></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.method-list{margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);list-style:none}.method-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fine-rule)}.method-list li>span{color:var(--signal)}.method-list h2{margin:0}.method-list p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}pre{overflow:auto;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--source)}</style>
